      "id": "document:packages/opencode/AGENTS.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "AGENTS.md",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/AGENTS.md",
      "summary": "Package-level engineering guide for the opencode core package, covering prompt architecture (shared core + provider delta), Drizzle database conventions, CLI event-loop design (LoopContext / FooterOutput contract), Effect v4 rules, module-shape conventions, and the V2 session delegation bridge. Injected into the agent's context as a user message on every LLM API call, so its file:line references directly shape agent behavior.",
      "tags": ["documentation", "conventions", "architecture", "effect", "agent-instructions"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "This file is re-read from disk on every LLM API call and injected as a user message per the Instruction Hierarchy pattern, so stale file:line anchors propagate directly into agent behavior."
    },
    {
      "id": "document:packages/opencode/BUN_SHELL_MIGRATION_PLAN.md",
