      "name": "BUN_SHELL_MIGRATION_PLAN.md",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/BUN_SHELL_MIGRATION_PLAN.md",
      "summary": "Phased migration plan to replace 143 runtime Bun `$` shell template calls across 17 source files with a unified Process API in util/process.ts. Prioritizes git-heavy hotspots (github.ts, worktree, LSP server, installation, snapshot) in Phase 1, with explicit shell-only exceptions and a validation strategy per phase.",
      "tags": ["documentation", "migration-plan", "process-api", "refactoring", "shell-commands"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
